{"id":"zorah","name":"Zorah","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:zorah"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Zorah","text":"Place of wasps, a town in the low country of Judah, afterwards given to Dan (Josh. 19:41; Judg. 18:2), probably the same as Zoreah (Josh. 15:33). This was Samson’s birthplace (Judg. 13:2, 25), and near it he found a grave (16:31). It was situated on the crest of a hill overlooking the valley of Sorek, and was fortified by Rehoboam (2 Chr. 11:10). It has been identified with Sur’ah, in the Wady Surar, 8 miles west of Jerusalem. It is noticed on monuments in the fifteenth century B.C. as attacked by the Abiri or Hebrews."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H6881","lemma":"צׇרְעָה","xlit":"Tsorʻâh","gloss":"Tsorah, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Zareah, Zorah, Zoreah","count":7,"share":0.78},{"strong":"H847","lemma":"אֶשְׁתָּאֹל","xlit":"ʼEshtâʼôl","gloss":"Eshtaol, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Eshtaol","count":4,"share":0.44},{"strong":"H4495","lemma":"מָנוֹחַ","xlit":"Mânôwach","gloss":"Manoach, an Israelite","kjv":"Manoah","count":2,"share":0.22},{"strong":"H3205","lemma":"יָלַד","xlit":"yâlad","gloss":"to bear young","kjv":"bear, beget, birth, born","count":2,"share":0.22}],"verses":["Josh.15.33","Josh.19.41","Judg.13.2","Judg.13.25","Judg.16.31","2Chr.11.10","Neh.11.29","Judg.13.24","Judg.18.0"],"related":[{"id":"eshtaol","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.333,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"judges-extraordinary","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.077,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"dan-the-tribe-of","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.067,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"samson","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.048,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"dan-the-tribe-of","type":"lexical","strong":"H6881","why":"both lead with צׇרְעָה (H6881)"},{"id":"eshtaol","type":"lexical","strong":"H6881","why":"both lead with צׇרְעָה (H6881)"}],"works":[{"work":"antiquities","title":"Antiquities of the Jews","count":1,"chapters":[{"chapter":"AntVIII.10","count":1,"book":"Ant. 8","title":"Concerning Rehoboam, And How God Inflicted Punishment Upon Him For His Impiety By Shishak [King Of Egypt]."}]}]}
